<title>USA: Terra Industries names operating officer.</title>
<headline>Terra Industries names operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terra Industries Inc said Thursday it named Michael Bennett, 43, executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Bennett had been senior vice president of Terra Industries and president of its distribution division. No successor was named as yet to the latter position, Terra said.</p>
<p>Terra Industries, with 1996 revenues of $2.3 billion, produces nitrogen fertilizer and crop protection products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
